Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:03.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的一集马上就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.17,0:00:07.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了找齐四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:09.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了用这把铁碎牙打败奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:12.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重返人间的亡魂集团七人帮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.18,0:00:15.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,袭击了我们藏身的小庙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.15,0:00:16.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千钧一发之际
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.65,0:00:18.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶来相救的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:19.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又碰上了新的对手了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:21.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 珊瑚 七宝跟云母
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.99,0:00:23.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿梭于时空 发生在战国时代与现代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.22,0:00:24.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.49,0:00:32.40,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分散在蓝蓝天空上的 七颗星星{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.93,0:00:36.80,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一颗星星 都刻着我的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:40.90,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算梦想被粉碎 我也要寻找爱{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:44.90,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:48.91,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧抓着我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.28,0:00:57.45,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些骗人的光阴 我再也不会输给它{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.49,0:01:02.62,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睁大眼睛 看清楚这瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.96,0:01:06.86,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它仍然紧紧围绕着我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.16,0:01:10.86,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人啜泣的 现实生活中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.14,0:01:14.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的…到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.11,0:01:18.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繁忙的这个世界{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:22.84,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永恒的碎片 忽隐又忽现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.11,0:01:26.88,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去触摸 去捕捉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.18,0:01:33.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.09,0:01:38.86,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了得到最后的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.13,0:01:45.90,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.45,0:02:03.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.72,0:02:05.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快趴下 七宝 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:11.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.45,0:02:33.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 刚刚放走了你那些伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:35.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下应该没有后顾之忧了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.96,0:02:39.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于醒了是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.12,0:02:40.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:42.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就安心的在这休养吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.63,0:02:47.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.67,0:02:49.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来这个人…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:52.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也是七人帮的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:00.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.68,0:03:03.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照这样看来也无法使出风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.82,0:03:05.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来只好孤注一掷了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:16.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我乖乖受死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:18.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.73,0:03:21.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:28.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:41.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.96,0:03:48.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.13,0:03:56.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第106话 戈薇 弥勒 珊瑚命在旦夕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:09.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这味道是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.25,0:04:12.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是尸体跟坟土的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.38,0:04:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道前面还有七人帮吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:18.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会 应该不是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.74,0:04:36.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股味道难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.49,0:04:52.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫非你…就是犬夜叉少爷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:55.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我恭候大驾很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.06,0:04:56.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.15,0:05:17.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你没事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.28,0:05:18.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于追到这里来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.65,0:05:21.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:23.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如你所见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.15,0:05:25.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是这座庙的和尚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:29.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些村民一直都传言得很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.89,0:05:34.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说十几年前丧命的那些七人帮亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.53,0:05:36.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道为什么死后复活了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:38.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四处危害这里的村民
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.30,0:05:41.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七人帮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:45.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才我埋葬的那些人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.81,0:05:48.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该就是被亡魂烧死的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.11,0:05:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道只有你一个人活了下来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:53.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时的情况实在太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.18,0:05:55.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吓得一直躲在菩萨后面不敢动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.82,0:05:58.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照这情形看来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.26,0:06:03.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你也被那些七人帮追捕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:04.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和尚 我可要说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:08.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是被他们追捕 而是我正在追捕他们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.27,0:06:09.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你知道的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:12.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不晓得可不可以告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:15.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个七人帮 为什么突然复活了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:20.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道又能怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.71,0:06:22.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我身为菩萨的弟子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.71,0:06:24.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着那么多人枉死却无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:28.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想做点事弥补
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:31.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以的话 我打算帮那些亡魂超渡一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股味道…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:38.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:41.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你屈屈一个和尚就能解决的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.10,0:06:45.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来这和尚不像是七人帮的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.37,0:06:48.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他身上还有活人的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.88,0:06:54.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:57.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞低一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.75,0:07:03.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.99,0:07:07.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是犬夜叉少爷的风之伤留下的痕迹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:09.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷大老远跑到北方来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.99,0:07:14.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果真不会是为了享受温泉这么简单才对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:21.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞高一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:23.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快飞高一点呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:33.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:36.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不快走就会完蛋的 鸟鸦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.53,0:07:44.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我们 钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.66,0:07:45.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一说到要去找戈薇大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:47.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙少主就跑得比飞还要快呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:52.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉那股臭味往哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.81,0:07:57.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…坟土的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:05.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说一个叫奈落的让亡魂死而复活
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.82,0:08:08.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个奈落到底是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.45,0:08:11.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个像妖怪的家伙啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.32,0:08:13.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:16.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是他并不是完全的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:18.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:21.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他早已经逃之夭夭不知道躲在哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:24.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜他一定是透过变身的手段
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.70,0:08:26.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断在累积自己的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:32.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些七人帮恐怕只是被他利用的傀儡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.16,0:08:49.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是银骨发动的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.63,0:08:51.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙难道还没死
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:58.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和尚 要命的话最好进去躲一躲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,银骨这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.94,0:09:10.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼看就要接近真相了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.95,0:09:11.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:16.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算让我知道奈落这家伙根本就信不过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.10,0:09:29.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这几个家伙也可以死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.47,0:09:33.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.17,0:09:36.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,银骨
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.11,0:09:40.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没打够是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.38,0:09:44.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:09:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又用钢索
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.63,0:09:59.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓住你了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.50,0:10:00.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:02.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭这点玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:06.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道就妄想…困得住我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:18.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死家伙去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.65,0:10:21.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会有一股烟味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:23.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.03,0:10:34.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是七人帮的炼骨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.37,0:10:35.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.87,0:10:40.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是刚刚那个和尚… 这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.37,0:10:41.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会有人的味道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.07,0:10:43.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.77,0:10:46.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛一脸不可置信的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.44,0:10:50.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是一向号称鼻子最灵的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.25,0:10:52.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么刚刚又会看走眼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:53.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.08,0:10:55.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道我身上一点都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.55,0:10:59.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七人帮的尸体跟坟土的味道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:01.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.59,0:11:03.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.76,0:11:05.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来这个地方是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.70,0:11:09.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座庙果然抢得很有价值
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.33,0:11:12.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整座庙四周都是坟墓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.47,0:11:15.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我身上的味道当然被盖过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.41,0:11:17.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更何况
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.57,0:11:19.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又穿上那个活人和尚的袈裟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:22.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要怪就怪你的鼻子实在太灵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.41,0:11:26.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闻到这些味道 马上就放了一百个心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:27.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.42,0:11:30.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这整座庙的和尚都已经被你给…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.99,0:11:32.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才你不是也看见
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.72,0:11:34.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经把他们给安葬了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:40.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才要是能够看穿你这点把戏就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.47,0:11:52.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那股烟是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.26,0:12:08.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.03,0:12:11.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不快起来 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:13.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我冥加爷爷呀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.66,0:12:14.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.54,0:12:25.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.84,0:12:27.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚闻着师父香炉里的香
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.84,0:12:28.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不小心就睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:31.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:33.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师快起来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.68,0:12:37.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.39,0:12:37.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:39.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都起不来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.56,0:12:40.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是之前中的毒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.40,0:12:46.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有毒烟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:51.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们一个也别想逃过我雾骨大爷的毒烟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.17,0:12:54.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你振作点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:12:58.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.31,0:13:01.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身上带着四魂之玉碎片的小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:03.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:07.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.08,0:13:07.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.89,0:13:10.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明给他们吃过解药了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.55,0:13:11.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道一点用都没有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.19,0:13:15.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我看先把火灭了再说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:17.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么办法 有没有什么办法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:22.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就用震荡陀螺刮起的大风吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.60,0:13:25.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术 震荡陀螺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.71,0:13:33.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会反效果呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.85,0:13:40.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.35,0:13:45.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然敢放火烧庙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:48.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这把火可以送他们上西天
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.73,0:13:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正他们已经中毒那么深了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:54.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:13:58.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.48,0:14:10.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么可以放你进去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.95,0:14:13.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个混帐…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.95,0:14:20.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚一直有股尸体跟坟土的味道传过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.40,0:14:32.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是妖狼族的钢牙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:34.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又有奇怪的家伙出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:35.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.17,0:14:39.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是凶骨那个笨怪物的同伙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.41,0:14:40.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们身上的臭味都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.78,0:14:43.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是来帮凶骨报仇的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.02,0:14:48.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身上穿的那条短短的裙子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:49.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉还真可爱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:54.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只可惜你不是我喜欢的那一型哪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.29,0:14:57.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那笨蛋在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.53,0:14:58.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就把你解决掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.44,0:15:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这句话应该我说才对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.64,0:15:13.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这把刀到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:16.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么像蛇一样弯来弯去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:19.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很忙啦 所以你最好乖乖别反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.22,0:15:23.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不然我会赶不上帮犬夜叉送终啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.69,0:15:24.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:26.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你刚说这话是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.16,0:15:29.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么你来不及帮犬夜叉送终
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:33.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉是你什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:34.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不管什么犬夜叉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.47,0:15:37.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我担心的是跟着他的那个可爱女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.17,0:15:39.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道 他们有危险了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.57,0:15:41.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好烦 又是女人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.34,0:15:45.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看他们早就完蛋了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.84,0:15:49.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.55,0:15:54.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:56.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 振作点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.05,0:15:58.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个时候受的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:23.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上帮你移开柱子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:28.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都晕过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.59,0:16:31.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们大家快醒醒 醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:37.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.10,0:16:46.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 这个时候我不可以哭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.17,0:16:48.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要坚强起来才行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.54,0:16:53.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉回来之前 我一定要好好保护他们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.68,0:16:55.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 光靠我一个人的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.65,0:16:57.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本搬不动他们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.28,0:16:58.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底该怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.92,0:17:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动动脑筋一定会想出办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:07.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:11.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就来救你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.56,0:17:15.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死心吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.57,0:17:17.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那些同伴全都完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.10,0:17:19.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是被我放的火烧死
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.70,0:17:21.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是毒发身亡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.40,0:17:23.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天你救不了他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.61,0:17:25.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少废话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.61,0:17:27.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.31,0:17:32.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要坚强起来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.35,0:17:34.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要坚强起来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.02,0:17:36.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要坚强起来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.55,0:17:39.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,银骨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.39,0:17:43.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这里面还有法宝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:49.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上把你刺穿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:52.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别做梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.63,0:18:18.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看刀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.13,0:18:27.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没了那把刀就只有认输啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:29.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.67,0:18:32.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.41,0:18:33.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.21,0:18:37.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别妄想了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.65,0:18:42.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老子今天没有空陪你玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.16,0:18:56.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.88,0:19:07.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寺庙已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.31,0:19:10.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 珊瑚 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.18,0:19:13.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我让开
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.49,0:19:22.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道连杀我的时间都没有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.76,0:19:25.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟敢瞧不起我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.00,0:19:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少稍微知道奈落是什么样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.23,0:19:31.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片也弄到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:34.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:38.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看今天就到此为止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:53.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.93,0:20:04.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓了我一大跳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.27,0:20:07.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有人像这小子一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.54,0:20:09.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能一再避开我的蛇骨刀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:13.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个臭小子倒是有点棘手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:20.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天本大爷没那么多闲功夫陪你玩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.32,0:20:21.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次再让我看见你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:23.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你的死期了 臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.75,0:20:25.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我 钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.99,0:20:27.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的毫不犹豫掉头就走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.09,0:20:29.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:45.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.05,0:20:52.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.59,0:20:58.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.36,0:21:03.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.93,0:21:07.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.63,0:21:11.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.10,0:21:16.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬…犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:18.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你没事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:24.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我…我跟自己说 一定要坚强起来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:26.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要坚强起来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.55,0:21:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你用狐火保护了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.32,0:21:32.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让大家不会被火烧伤对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.09,0:21:36.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.39,0:21:39.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.10,0:21:41.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明明已经尽全力了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.54,0:21:52.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人全都断气了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.59,0:22:15.09,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红红的太阳照亮一切{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.67,0:22:24.87,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也照遍过去和现在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.14,0:22:34.14,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些夕阳下的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.42,0:22:44.09,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这颗心真的能承担吗{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.69,0:22:49.10,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我什么办法才能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.23,0:22:53.86,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过得比以前更开朗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.17,0:23:01.41,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做就算会让自己委屈{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.21,0:23:07.67,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}默默承受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.98,0:23:12.18,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.46,0:23:19.42,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌仍会不断在我心中回荡{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.00,0:23:29.20,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌才是我的路标{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.43,0:23:52.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人全都断气了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.30,0:23:54.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都要怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.53,0:23:56.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我早点看穿炼骨的谎言就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.27,0:23:59.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在后悔什么 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.30,0:23:59.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.30,0:24:02.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说穿了你不过是个半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:04.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光是保护自己就已经很勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.27,0:24:06.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当初却让你拥有一把用来守护人的刀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.21,0:24:08.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从一开始就太强人所难
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.25,0:24:11.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.48,0:24:13.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉初次落下男儿泪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.12,0:24:14.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一定不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.32,0:24:16.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你睁开眼睛吧 戈薇
